ps://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_1437045914484500_6531010984390686064_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NSjETLh52b0Q7kNvwFfkrjX&_nc_oc=AdoDp_PjvgwPUSH4VsxbuOUl8HUNf5VyncRKDL-EDzLEPPJNVzAkID2t6gLZ_1QVUAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVIzEs65JO32hR7ZWd6aBluHnTcnaofQri4UJsJMY8lw&oe=6A9D7F89"}, {"file_name": "SS5.png", "id": "1431256521795682", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822550_1431256525129015_6283571462038955726_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=js4XzWFlI8YQ7kNvwFQz35V&_nc_oc=AdoI6DjOYjlElClwax9apO1qKnggf_mrNwwLlZhMv8ZhYCFpr8ydbKLTynPm76LbtdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJbUXDBWuO07xC4f8D1byBkRrstANTh7yKoVqMVt2QLzA&oe=6A9D61F6"}, {"file_name": "SS4.png", "id": "911792094868093", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_911792101534759_6540708280159999494_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LRFO5-53ZCQQ7kNvwHoKfYf&_nc_oc=AdoFSCZeUDF0WZUeel8btbg2C-igQkAsu-o9OckHFOsgKUqrxVBDRxoy7r7Tb8zrxE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKi2Bh2f7qUfTQUoRLIyD_oPlP0fEgG4wVdLA2DxIiavQ&oe=6A9D7482"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "26173393872255884", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491829120_26173393898922548_8607957351393534504_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NHIQ_WsIR4YQ7kNvwEDSfHy&_nc_oc=AdrG3sCN9G09f5hGt3E1N7k-MxYGggyAfF5QtMAbis75pL6kwbrNV6xXV1MvxIz9VNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIYhdVAMhYOR-V_g8a8S8qexwe0SgLyfxSP1M_nyBs5sQ&oe=6A9D7F44"}, "display_name": "Echo Drift Demo", "keywords": ["driving", "racing", "single", "echo", "drift"], "long_description": "Strap into the Echo Drift Demo, a gritty slice of high-octane hover-racing in a dystopia where the Five Corps rule a shattered world fueled by alien Echo meteors. Select from 5 unique hovercars\u2014converted everyday beaters, each fitted with glowing Echo coils for gravity-defying drifts\u2014and battle 6 AI drivers in intense offline races across part of the Cybmat Corp-Partly Park Competition.\nTackle two epic tracks at varying times of day:\n\nPartly Park: Skim over cracked dirt trails through overgrown corporate nostalgia as perpetual dust storms under the skies in the distance.\nWaterway: High-speed laps around a vast, murky lake on weathered tarmac, threading hover-drifts between flooded overpasses and race over the dam.\n\nMaster Echo bursts to outmaneuver the pack, feel the G-forces in VR, and chase leaderboard glory. No online needed\u2014this demo delivers raw, adrenaline-pumped action straight from the meteor-scarred future. \n\nDemo Features:\n$30,000 to buy and test some cars and updates\n5 customizable hovercars\n2 tracks x day/sunset variants\n6 AI opponents\nPure offline VR racing fun\n\nDownload now and drift into the electric haze! \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udca8\nFull game coming later this year, with global circuits!  open world free mode with friends, Online racing (tested and it's a hell of alot of fun) and much much more to come\nPlus come join the Discord for a Alpha version to take part and help build a great VR racer. ", "short_description": "Welcome to the Echo Drift Alpha Demo\nEcho Drift Demo: Hover-race 5 cars against 6 rivals across Partly Park's dusty track and Waterway's tarmac lake laps in part of Cybmat Corp's brutal circuits. Offline VR action\u2014day or dusk!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://markledson28.wixsite.com/moonshinegames/copy-of-contact-details", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MoonShineGames", "support_website_url": "https://markledson28.wixsite.com/moonshinegames/contact", "website_url": "https://markledson28.wixsite.com/moonshinegames", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags":